mpv is built with -Dgpl=false and FFmpeg with --disable-gpl --enable-version3, so no GPL or nonfree
component is included. No decoder is removed by this: H.264, HEVC, AV1 and VP9 are FFmpeg-native.

The LGPL components are linked into libmpv.so inside the AAR. Corresponding source is this
repository and the pinned upstream revisions recorded in buildscripts/include/depinfo.sh. Exact
commits and checksums for a given build are recorded in that release's assets.
